DOMAIN,itunes.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,apps.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,play.itunes.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,search.itunes.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,pd.itunes.apple.com
