DOMAIN-SUFFIX,se2.itunes.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,myapp.itunes.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,misc-assets.itunes.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,streamingaudio.itunes.apple.com
